# Layout standard for ezkey-pam.
# Analog of google-java-format: one community preset, almost no local taste.
# BasedOnStyle Google is the preset (2-space indent, 80 columns, K&R braces,
# pointer on the left). SortIncludes stays Never because feature-test macros
# and the system-vs-local include split in this module are order-sensitive.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
SortIncludes: Never
